    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a bold and challenging pixel style top-down shooting game, where players will transform into a naked boy and shoot security guards in an artistic campus, challenging their reaction speed and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a lot of interesting content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting combat system that utilizes various techniques and strategies to engage in confrontation, defeat enemies, and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique storyline, interwoven with thrilling battles, where players can not only engage in a barrage of challenges but also engage in dialogue with NPCs to drive the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite visual effects, exquisite pixel style restore the unique scenery of the campus, immersive visual design, bringing a full sense of immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention: This game contains adult content and mild violent scenes, and is only suitable for players aged 18 and above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
